Subject: [PATCH 069/158] [NOT FOR UPSTREAM] Add DSDT config for original Ally
 older BIOSes

Older ROG Ally BIOSes do not have a speaker configuration in the DSDT.
Patch is originally by Jonathan LoBue <jlobue10@gmail.com>.
---
